        "sid": "JDG 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli, haguma Dani mirgaa bahe Beersheba bitaati d'aabe, lafa Gileadi, ta ilaboru woliini, yaamicha kana d'agaye, haguma gahuni, Mispati AABBO Waaqa durati wolti bahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gugurdaani gosa Israeli ch'ufti woltibahisa gumiini Waaqa wolti baate keesa jira, ammalle askarti nama kuma d'ibba afuri ka miilaani yauti gumi tana keesa jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle worri Benjamini, aka worri Israeli ch'ufti Mispati wolti bahe d'agaye, duuba worri Israeli namicha Lawi kaani gaafate waan jed'eeni, Aka hameenni kunini gula d'ufe nuti himi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi Lawi, ka gaarayu isaa ijeesani kaani, waan jed'e, Anaafi gaarayuni tiyya dira Gibea, ka lafa Benjamini, bulle jennaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "worri Gibea d'ufe na had'e, mana keesati na marse na ijeesu fed'e, ammo eege gaarayu tiyya buufate ijeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini reefa isii fuud'e gargari ch'ire, gosa kud'ani lama ta Israeli toko tokooni iti erge. Wonti anini akasi tolcheefi, worra kanati hameennaafi daba takuma inargini nu keesati tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma isani worri Israeli, dubbi tana dubbad'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani nami ch'ufti olkae, woligale waan jed'e, Nu nami tokoleeni ka waarofi manati galuleeni worrati indeebiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti nu taanu tana: hit'a buufanne, nama Gibea had'u fohanna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'ibba ch'ufa keesa nami kud'ani ka Israeli woreega worra duulatini d'ufe, kaaleni Gibea d'aqe haalo bafata, maro daba taka inargini ka Israeli keesati tolchani kaanifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli ch'ufti garaa tokooni wolti bahe, aka dira suni had'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Israeli ch'ufti nama ergaa lafa gosa Benjamini keesa ergite waan jette, Dabi hamani kunini maani, ka isani tolchitani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hurrisa, worra algala hama daba kana hojatte nuti kenna, aka nu worra find'e hameenna kana gosa Israeli keesaa baamnu. Ammo worri Benjamini dubbi worra odula kaasu dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo dira lafa Benjamini ch'ufa keesaa bahani Gibea d'ufani, aka worra Israeli kaani d'ibi had'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya suni worri nama kuma diddami jaa dira ch'ufa keesaa wolti yaame. Worra kana male, worri Gibea nama d'ibba torba ka ch'ufa bitaacha ka filani wolti baase. Worri sunini ch'uftinu guddo gulubaani d'akha darbu beekha rifeensa matale ind'abu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15+JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15",
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Israeli taani nama duula, ka kuma d'ibba afuri, wolti baafte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Had'i worra Benjamini had'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli ch'ufti Betheli d'aqe, Waaqa gaafate waan jed'ani gochiti qara Benjamini haatu tami? AABBO Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Gosa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli boriyya lafa d'aatu Gibeati nanae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worra Benjamini had'u d'aqani, askarti d'aatu dirati kurfeesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuli worra Benjamini diraa gabahe, ato guyyaani inhobaini askarti Israeli kuma diddami lama hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli fulla Waaqa iti kad'atani taani d'aqe, haga galgala AABBO Waaqa durati bohe waan jed'eeni, Nu deebine oboleyaani teenna ta Benjamini inaana? Jennaani AABBO Waaqi ee jed'eeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba duuli Israeli garaa jabaate, askarti isaani fulluma qara worri kale jiruti deebise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duula worra Benjamini maro lameeso had'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle akuma suni worri Benjamini Gibea keesaa bahe, askarti Israeli ta guddo had'iisa barate, nama kuma kud'ani saddeeti, gate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli Betheli d'aqe bohe, achiti worri AABBO Waaqa dura tae haga galgala ufi agabse, sorio gubanifi ta wold'ageeti AABBO Waaqaa baasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi Sanduqi Wold'aqisa Waaqaa Betheli jira, Finehasi, ilmi Eleazari, ka akhaakhu Haruniti, huji isaa harkaa qaba. Biyyiti AABBO Waaqa gaafate waan jette ammalle yaane oboleyaani teenna ta Benjamini inhaana mo yala baana?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Beena, had'a, bori indabsatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli askarti gari Gibea dira d'aatuti d'osse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duuba maro sadeeso duula Benjamini had'ani, akuma qara kaani askarti worra Gibea d'aatuti kurfeesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Benjamini akuma qara had'iisa gabahe jennaani sobani dira iraa fageesani. Duuba akuma qara kaani worri askarti Israeli had'e, ballinna lafa, kara Betheliti deemufi ka Gibeati deemu keesaleti, nama sodoma fit'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Benjamini waan jed'e, Akuma qara kaani yayu worra dabsanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo worri Israeli qara waan jed'e, Koota, duraa baqanne, dira worra ira fageesine, karaati d'ieesina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba duuli Israeli dudda duuba deebie. Baal-Tamariti ch'ibra tolfatani, jari Gibea marse kaani fulla iti d'okhate ta d'akhaye, ta d'aatu dira taani, gadi bafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami kuma kud'ani ka Israeli keesaa filani kaani aka jaba Gibeati woli had'ani. Worri Benjamini, aka badiini worra geete, kana inhubanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi askarti Israeli worra Benjamini dabsachiise. Worri Israeli nama kuma diddami shanitiifi d'ibba toko ijeese, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jennaani worri Benjamini aka dabsatani hubate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Israeli worra dabsate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti worri Israeli worra Benjamini duraa baqatefi, worri worra d'aatu Gibea d'okhate kaani abdate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari d'okhate suni Gibea duude, dirati gargari bahe, nama ch'ufa hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba duula Israeli kaanifi jari Israeli ka d'okhate kaani qara akheekha woli kenne, akheekhi sunini kana: hojja aara ibida ka aka dumansa olbahu argani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli ka qara nyaapa duraa baqate kaani iti garagala. Yo suni worri Benjamini ya worra Israeli nama sodoma ijeese waan woliini jed'e, Akuma qara kaani ya worra dabsanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani akheekhi kaani mullate, aari guddaani aka dumansa dira keesa olbahe. Worri Benjamini kaani ufi duuba millannaani dira ch'ufa ka gubate bobau arge mame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli garagale jennaani worri Benjamini baddi ufi arge mudame, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "worra Israeli duraa lafa diidati baqate, ammo worra duraa bahu dad'abe. Wonti akanatiifi worra yayu gama lachuyu marsani, worri dira keesa jiru kaani gabahe worra balleese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli worra marse, duuba ato miila ind'aabatini, haga Gibeani ilaboru worra reebe karaati hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama kuma saddeeti ka Benjamini jajanna ch'alla fit'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari kaani d'ibiini garagale, lafa diida ta d'akhaye Rimoniti baqate. Ammalle nama kuma shani karaati fit'ani. Ka hafele gara Gidomu gussani nama kuma lama keesaa fit'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami Benjamini ka gaafasi fit'ani ch'ufti wolti nama kuma diddami shani, ka ch'ufti jajanna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo nami d'ibba jaa lafa aloo ta d'akha Rimoniti baqate bahe, haga jia afuri achi tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli garagale d'iirafi nad'eenifi ijoolle ammalle horile ch'ufa fit'e, dira arda suni ch'ufa gube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka nad'eeni gosa worra Benjamini barbaadani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
